Subject: CPMS I03E2 Seed Case and Mutation Operator Catalogue Source
Description: Manager-derived source for designing reviewed seed archetypes and layer-typed deterministic mutation operators that can later propose a minimal I03E corpus against I03E1 obligations. Formation creates no concrete fixture, expected verdict, reader execution, or implementation authority.

